    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 24 • Negotiating A Purchase",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Jack, owner of Jack's Party Store, is negotiating to buy an advertisement in the Newport Times. Dave is an ad salesman with the newspaper."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "My store is having a big sale next week. I'd like to buy a small advertisement in the Sunday edition of the Newport Times. How much would a quarter page cost?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "A quarter page ad costs $250. What you really need is a full page ad if you want to "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"make a splash"
            },
            {
              "text":	". That would be $900. I better reserve that for you before we run out of space."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Don't try to give me "
            },
            {
              "text":	"the hard sell"
            },
            {
              "text":	". Nine hundred bucks would "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"break my budget!"
            },
            {
              "text":	"!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Okay, so we're looking at a quarter page. For another $200 I can make it a full color ad. Color would give you "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"more bang for the buck"
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Of course color is better than black and white. That's a "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"no-brainer"
            },
            {
              "text":	"! Can you "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"throw that in at no extra charge"
            },
            {
              "text":	"?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Sorry, "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"no can do."
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Your competitor, the Newport Bulletin, is offering me a quarter page color ad for $300. That's very attractive since I'm "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"on a tight budget"
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "The Newport Bulletin? This is "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"off the record"
            },
            {
              "text":	", but you really don't want to advertise in that rag! Nobody reads it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Here's my final offer: I'll take a quarter page color ad in your paper for $350 and not a penny more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "How about we find a "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"happy medium"
            },
            {
              "text":	". I'll give it to you for $400."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Jack: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Please don't try to "
            },
            {
              "text":	"nickel-and-dime"
            },
            {
              "text":	" me. I'm "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"standing firm"
            },
            {
              "text":	" at $350."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Dave: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Okay, I don't want to spend all afternoon arguing. "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"It's a deal"
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
